flowchart TB
    accTitle: Public findings, source exports and deployment have different gates
    accDescr: Existing public maintenance uses its current scope. Proposed private source exports need scope, terms, snapshot and allowlist review. Withheld work stays private but returns a public-safe summary. Main merge precedes separately requested release and deployment.
    OUT["What output should become public?"]:::hub
    FIND["Findings / catalog / guide\nPublic-safe outcome and references\nNo restricted source or payload"]:::evidence
    EXIST["Existing approved public source\nPublic mods / research or Phone\nMaintain destination's current scope"]:::public
    PROPOSE["Proposed source export\nPrivate mod / generic server example / tool\nNot approved just because cataloged"]:::gate
    SCOPE{"Owner approves public scope?"}:::gate
    TERMS{"Provenance + terms resolved?\nCode, dependencies and derived inputs"}:::gate
    SNAP["Prepare bounded public snapshot\nNo private history, data or assets\nInspect every added / removed file"]:::gate
    MAN["Review destination allowlist / hashes\nCorrect notices + corresponding source\nApplicable build/tests + boundary checks"]:::gate
    HOLD["WITHHELD / BLOCKED\nKeep implementation and full evidence private\nReturn safe reason and pending step"]:::blocked
    PR["Destination contribution\nExplicit commit -> push -> PR\nReview + required checks"]:::public
    MAIN["MERGED SOURCE / FINDINGS\nPublic main + exact commit\nNot automatically installed or deployed"]:::public
    ART["Separate artifact release\nBuild from merged owner revision\nPackage source / notices / hashes"]:::release
    SITE["Separate website download publication\nOwner publishing rules and authorization\nVerify published artifact record"]:::release
    LIVE["Separate live server/service deployment\nOwning main / declared production branch\nRecord deployment and stop for owner verification"]:::release
    BACK["Return actual outcome here\nMerged is not released is not deployed\nFailures and withheld reasons included"]:::evidence
    OUT --> FIND & EXIST & PROPOSE
    FIND --> PR
    EXIST --> PR
    PROPOSE --> SCOPE
    SCOPE -->|"Yes"| TERMS
    SCOPE -->|"No / pending"| HOLD
    TERMS -->|"Yes"| SNAP
    TERMS -->|"No / pending"| HOLD
    SNAP --> MAN --> PR --> MAIN
    HOLD --> BACK
    MAIN --> BACK
    MAIN -. "When requested / authorized" .-> ART
    ART -. "When requested / authorized" .-> SITE
    MAIN -. "When requested / authorized" .-> LIVE
    ART --> BACK
    SITE --> BACK
    LIVE --> BACK
    classDef hub fill:#dceaff,stroke:#245fa8,color:#132d50,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef public fill:#dcf5e7,stroke:#23724d,color:#123b29;
    classDef gate fill:#fff0ca,stroke:#9a6a16,color:#543b0e;
    classDef evidence fill:#e2ebff,stroke:#526eb1,color:#263963;
    classDef blocked fill:#ffe2df,stroke:#a74d46,color:#59251f;
    classDef release fill:#ffe8d5,stroke:#a26026,color:#54320f;
